<p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>

<p>Congratulations! We are pleased to inform you that your application to volunteer with Cedarrise has been accepted.</p>

<p>You have been accepted to support the following volunteer area(s):</p>

<ul>
  <% volunteerAreas.forEach((area) => { %>
    <li><%= area %></li>
  <% }) %>
</ul>

<p>We are excited to have you join us in supporting Cedarrise's work and contributing meaningfully to the communities we serve.</p>

<p>A member of our team may contact you with further information regarding your responsibilities, schedule, and next steps.</p>

<p>If you have any questions, please contact an administrator.</p>

<p>The Cedarrise Team</p>
